This directory vendors three files from the AVA-AI-Voice-Agent-for-Asterisk
project (https://github.com/hkjarral/AVA-AI-Voice-Agent-for-Asterisk),
used under the MIT License:

  - ari_client.py       (Asterisk ARI REST/WebSocket client)
  - rtp_server.py        (bidirectional RTP over Asterisk externalMedia)
  - audio/resampler.py  (audio resampling helpers)

Each file's docstring notes the specific (minor) changes made when vendoring
it here. logging_config.py in this directory is an independent, minimal
implementation written for this bridge — not vendored from that project.

